  - "R"
abstract: >-
  Analysis code for identifying clinical subphenotypes in HIV-associated sepsis:
  Gaussian mixture model (GMM) clustering, latent class analysis as a methodological
  comparison, external cohort validation, between-subtype statistics, LASSO/Logistic
  prediction modelling, calibration assessment, publication figures, and a Shiny
  prediction application. The repository contains code only; no patient-level data
  are included.
